### 数据库管理 - magic-api 管理 API
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8090

### ========== 1. 创建「数据库管理」分组 ==========

### 1.1 创建分组
POST {{baseUrl}}/magic/web/resource/folder/save
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "a1b2c3d4e5f6a7b8c9d0e1f2a3b4c5d6",
  "name": "数据库管理",
  "parentId": "2ud9c5419ag5484mbxxsafin0b0myji0",
  "type": "api",
  "path": "database",
  "paths": [],
  "options": []
}

### ========== 2. 测试 API 端点 ==========

### 2.1 获取表列表
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/database/tables

### 2.2 执行 SELECT 查询
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/database/query
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sql": "SELECT 1 AS test"
}

### 2.3 执行写操作（预览）
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/database/execute
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sql": "UPDATE t_inventory SET qty = qty WHERE 1 = 0",
  "confirmed": false
}
